">Submissions</a><div class="tab_group"><a class="header_tab" href="/jam/micro-jam-062/community">Community</a><span class="community_activity">13</span></div><a data-label="tab_view_jam_feed" class="header_tab" href="/jam/micro-jam-062/feed">Submission feed</a></div></div></div><div class="submitter_outer"><div class="jam_submitter_widget base_widget during_submit" id="jam_submitter_5983722"><div class="date_data">Submissions open from <span data-format="MMMM Do YYYY [at] h:mm A" class="date_format">2026-08-01 01:00:00</span> to <span data-format="MMMM Do YYYY [at] h:mm A" class="date_format">2026-08-03 02:00:00</span></div><div class="countdown"><span class="countdown_label">Submissions due in</span><div class="times"><div data-name="years" class="time_block"><div class="block_value"></div><div class="block_label">years</div></div><div data-name="months" class="time_block"><div class="block_value"></div><div class="block_label">months</div></div><div data-name="days" class="time_block"><div class="block_value"></div><div class="block_label">days</div></div><div data-name="hours" class="time_block"><div class="block_value"></div><div class="block_label">hours</div></div><div data-name="minutes" class="time_block"><div class="block_value"></div><div class="block_label">minutes</div></div><div data-name="seconds" class="time_block"><div class="block_value"></div><div class="block_label">seconds</div></div></div></div><div class="state_action"><button class="button fat submitter_button join_jam_btn" data-href="/jam/417948/join" data-method="post">Join jam</button></div></div></div><div class="jam_content user_formatted"><p><br></p>
<p><br></p>
<h3></h3>
<h3>‼️ Due to the <u>summer season</u>, Micro Jam is offering $400 USD worth of CASH prizes&nbsp;‼️</h3>
<h2></h2>
<p><br></p>
<h2>💡 WHAT IS MICRO JAM?<strong><br><br></strong></h2>
<p><strong>Micro Jam</strong> is a bi-weekly Game Jam (game development competition) held on itch.io. Every Jam has a pre-set theme and a surprise prerequisite that is divulged once the Jam starts. The prerequisite can be voted on in the <a style="background-color: var(--itchio_white_back)" href="https://discord.gg/micro-jam-1190868995226730616" rel="nofollow noopener" referrerpolicy="origin">Micro Jam Discord server</a> and is open for interpretation.</p>
<p><br></p>
<p>It&#x27;s absolutely fine if you do not finish your game in time. You can submit it late within <strong>6 </strong><strong>hours</strong> after the submission window closes!<br><em>▸And special thanks to <a target="_blank" href="https://opr.as/GameMaker-Micro-Jam" rel="nofollow noopener" referrerpolicy="origin">GameMaker</a> and <a href="https://ziva.sh/" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener" referrerpolicy="origin">Ziva</a> for sponsoring and making these jams possible.</em></p>
<p>Micro Jam Official website: <a href="https://www.microjam.xyz/" rel="nofollow noopener" referrerpolicy="origin">https://www.microjam.xyz/</a></p>
<h4><a href="https://discord.gg/micro-jam-1190868995226730616" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener" referrerpolicy="origin">➤ Discord</a> <a href="https://twitter.com/MicroJamm" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener" referrerpolicy="origin">➤ Twitter</a></h4>
<hr>
<h2>📖 THEME:</h2>
<p>This week&#x27;s theme for Micro Jam 062 is<strong> Speed!</strong></p>
<p>This is open for interpretation, but just remember that the use of theme is a criterion being voted on.<br></p>
<p><br></p>
<hr>
<h2>📝 PREREQUISITE:</h2>
<p>The prerequisite is:&nbsp;<strong>Speed is your weapon!</strong><br></p>
<hr>
<h2>💸 SPONSORED BY:</h2>
<p>Thank you to our amazing sponsors! This Jam would not be running without them, so please click on their graphic to learn more about them:</p>
<p><br></p>
<p><a href="https://opr.as/GameMaker-Micro-Jam" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener" referrerpolicy="origin"><img src="https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI4MjAwMDg2LnBuZw==/original/1of5cV.png" loading="lazy"></a><br></p>
<p><a href="https://ziva.sh/" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener" referrerpolicy="origin"><img src="https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI4MjAwMDg5LnBuZw==/original/douDb3.png" loading="lazy"></a></p>
<p><a href="https://craftpix.net/?utm_source=itch.io&utm_medium=gamejam&utm_campaign=micro-jam" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener" referrerpolicy="origin"><img src="https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI4MjAwMDk2LnBuZw==/original/q%2FzHXs.png" loading="lazy"></a><br></p>
<p><a href="https://easel.games/" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener" referrerpolicy="origin"><img src="https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI4MjAwMDkyLnBuZw==/original/96tdb3.png" loading="lazy"></a><br></p>
<p><br></p>
<p><br></p>
<hr>
<h2>💰 PRIZES:</h2>
<p><strong><em>▸First of all</em></strong><em>, everyone can get a certificate of participation upon request in our <a href="http://discord.gg/aaeF3AFZ53" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener" referrerpolicy="origin">Discord server</a>!</em></p>
<p>Our current CASH prize pool (per biweekly Jam) is ~$400 USD 💸:</p>
<p><br></p>
<p><strong>🤖 Best Games Made With GameMaker:</strong>
<br><em>▸If you used GameMaker, please add the tag #gamemaker to your itch.io page.</em></p>
